[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/World/MapLocationComponent.cs" id="maploc_39_5a"]

; THE PRESERVED CITY (hidden realm) — Vesperhold. Every house is in perfect repair and nobody has
; needed one in four hundred years. Its four residents are UNDYING, not undead: peaceful villagers who
; keep the same hours every day (their schedules), and whose talk is the bargain. The Queen's hostile
; servants are the realm's encounters and never spawn inside the city's safe radius.
;
; Authored in the content frame; tools/shift_cell_content.py moves it to the spec's origin.
; Streets: south (0,22)->(0,0), north (0,0)->(0,-24), east lane (0,0)->(25,0); nothing within 4.5 m
; of a centreline.

